    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The Popup made simple is a WordPress plugin that enables you to easily add customizable pupup to your pages using the Gutenberg editor.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<p>You must add class &#8220;accept-action&#8221; to button if you want to use custom &#8220;Accept&#8221; button</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Go to your WordPress dashboard. Install the plugin either via the WordPress plugin directory or by navigating to Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload Plugin. Choose the downloaded zip file and click Install Now. Then, activate the plugin.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p>The plugin is published.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "The plugin enables you to easily add customizable popups to your posts and pages using the Gutenberg editor.",
